window.products.push({"id":839125,"name":"Beautiful Sophia Loren Amazing Face Black and White Wall Art Icon Art Canvas Print Home Decor Wrapped and Stretched - Ready to Hang -%100 Handmade in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vTe0AhDeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Proudly Made in the USA.  MADE TO ORDER:  All products made to order. So please make sure about your order size is correct before checking out. STRETCHER BARS:  We use 0.75\" thick stretcher bars and all durable shrink resistant frames for gallery quality profile. Only 30\" x 40\" and 40\" x 30\" stretcher bars are 1.50\" thick. READY TO HANG: Our canvas prints are READY TO HANG unless stated ROLLED UP in the size option. ROLLED UP OPTION (Only for 30\" x 40\" or 40\" x 30\" size)  We have two options for 30\" x 40\" or 40\" x 30\" sizes. If you chose ROLLED UP size option, your canvas will come rolled up in a tube and it will be NOT READY TO HANG. When you stretched the canvas, you will need borders so mirroring borders will be added to the actual picture. You will receive the canvas bigger than actual size which is stated in the size option because of the mirroring. Rolled up canvas will be 34\" x 44\" or 44\" x 34\" including mirroring borders (2\" for each edge). When you stretched the canvas, we suggest you use up to 1.5\" thick (Depth) and 30\" x 40\" or 40\" x 30\" (Height x Width) stretcher bars for the best result. CANVAS MIRRORED BORDERS: All the products have mirroring edges to keep all image on the front of the canvas. A portion of your image will be mirrored or reflected over the sides. The image does not wrap around the stretcher bars. The result look keeps the original image in full view. NOTE: Due to differing calibration of every monitor, actual canvas colors may be slightly different from the product image.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vTe0AhDeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buy4Wall","source_asin":"B07GP299D4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GP299D4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GP299D4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839126,"name":"SIMPLY ECO Sturdy Reusable Canvas Shopping Tote Bag for Groceries and Cotton Reusable Mesh Produce Bags with Drawstring for Fruits and Veggies (L,M.S)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BaYvV-eGL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"6 set environment friendly bags Simply Eco reusable produce bags help pave the way for a better future with environmental awareness and better care for your produce to reduce food waste. We have designed the perfect set with reusable mesh bags and tote shopping bag, incorporating all the best attributes we could think of. By combining high-quality, unbleached cotton, eco-friendly materials and uncompromising strength, we have designed mesh and Canvas eco-bags, alternative to the plastic bags and containers.Our cotton, eco produce bags can ideally be used for farmers markets, vegan foods grocery, as a vegetable saver or even as a beach bag. Comfortable mesh bags for toys, school lunches, office supplies, camping & road trips.We highly recommend the following, in order to ensure long lasting of your products:- Don’t pack veggies tightly together, either; they need space for air circulation;- Fruits and vegetables don’t play well together. So don’t store them together;- Always remove any tight bands from your veggies;- In the mesh bags, we recommend store oranges, lemons and grapefruit outside of the crispers. Also potatoes, sweet potatoes, onions and garlic. Mesh bags are NOT RECOMMENDED for leafy veggies;The produce bag set comes in 3 different sizes:Cotton Mesh Bags:1* Small 10x8\"2* Medium 10x12\"2* Large 12x15\" Canva Shopping Bag:13x13x8\"Wash by hand or washing machine with cold water in a delicate cycle.We guarantee complete satisfaction and high-quality reusable cotton mesh and muslin bags. Live healthier, reuse your bags and save the environment with these amazing zero waste veggie bags today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BaYvV-eGL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Eco","source_asin":"B07QWY47LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QWY47LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QWY47LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
