window.products.push({"id":839138,"name":"College Dorm Laundry Bags - Versatile and Heavy Duty College Laundry Hamper Liner with Drawstring - Canvas Laundry Basket Liner - 100% Cotton, Washabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ikqD5scNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Versatile College Laundry Bags - These laundry bags are extremely versatile and can be used as standalone laundry bags and also as a laundry hamper liner. Work Smarter, Not Harder using these cotton laundry bags in your college dorm. Forget hauling a bulky laundry sack across town to the laundromat. Conveniently carry your drawstring laundry bag with 2 sturdy handles. Heavy Duty Canvas Dorm Laundry Bags - These laundry bags are made from high quality cotton canvas materials. You can easily wash and reuse them since they are heavy duty and double stitched for durability. Your laundry hamper bag is made from organic materials and packaged without plastic Multi-Use Laundry Basket Liners — Line wicker and wooden hampers with these laundry hamper liner to keep it fresh. Use as a comforter or sleeping bag storage sack. Or simply carry dirty laundry to the laundry room in these handy laundry bag. Designed to make your life easier, whatever the use Large Laundry Bag for College Students with a Hanging Hook — We understand that as a college student you need a large laundry bag. This is for you. You can also easily hang this bag in your room if you do not have a hamper. The bag comes with a hook that can be used to hang and carry the whole bag to laundromat when full. The large laundry bag allows you to fit 3 to 4 week's worth of laundry. Keep your dirty clothes discrete. Just pull the drawstring right and be on your way Machine Washable and Foldable Laundry Bags — These laundry bags are themselves washable. Keep your laundry bags fresh by simply popping it in the washing machine on a cold, gentle cycle. These bags are also foldable and easy to carry if empty. Just fold them up while you're waiting for your cycle at the laundromat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ikqD5scNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Organic Cotton Mart","source_asin":"B0BFP6452D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFP6452D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFP6452D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
