window.products.push({"id":839319,"name":"Leg Daddy 4\" Dark Finish Square Tapered Pyramid Wooden Sofa Legs, Set of 4, 5/16\" Hanger Bolt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H2YdmTPbL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our sofa legs are not just for the sofa. They also fit well and look well on chairs, ottomans, and other furniture items. The Importance of Good Sofa LegsYour entire sofa, chair, ottoman and other furniture pieces rest on the leg. If the leg is loose or otherwise defective, the result can be an uncomfortable use of the furniture. Defective legs can lead to structural damage to the furniture item because of uneven stress loads being placed on the frame. It is important, not only for appearance sake, but also for the well being of your furniture to keep the legs in good repair. The Leg Daddy 4\" Dark Finish Tapered Pyramid Sofa Leg This leg is attached to the furniture item with a 5/16\" hanger bolt. Attachment and removal of the leg is easy. The leg is simply turned to the right to install and to the left to remove. This wooden leg is beautifully finished in a Dark Walnut finish which highlights the grain beautifully. The wood is strong and durable and is equipped with a plastic glide on the bottom of the leg. Special Note Please be advised that there are two common sizes of Hanger Bolts. The most common size hanger bolt for American-Made furniture is 5/16\". For imported furniture, especially from Europe (IKEA, Natuzzi, etc.), the larger Metric 10mm (M10) size is common. These sofa legs are NOT compatible with M10 attachment points. Variation in Color and Grain of Wood Furniture Legs Please note that wood is a naturally sourced material, with naturally-occurring variations in color, texture, and grain pattern. As a result, each couch leg may differ slightly from the photograph shown on the website. LEG DADDY is a registered trademark of Homeplace Group, Inc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H2YdmTPbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEG DADDY","source_asin":"B00ATQRJR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ATQRJR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ATQRJR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
