window.products.push({"id":839386,"name":"Jokari Butter Pro, One Size, Green and Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41J5oAA642L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Measures one serving at a time. Butter is frequently over used adding empty calories to foods. The Healthy Steps Butter Pro measures one serving of butter at time so you can be confident in your portion sizes and yourself. Top rack dishwasher safe for easy clean up. How to use: For tub butter: - Scoop butter into flex spoon. One spoonful is equal to one serving. Turn over spoon and press flex spoon to release butter. - Use knife to spread butter, if needed. For stick or cube butter: - Align the Butter Pro knife with butter stick or cube. Using tooth on end of knife mark a notch into butter. Following the notch, cut the butter. One notch is equal to one serving. Benefits of Butter Pro: While fats and oils are an important part of a healthy diet, limiting the amount consumed is best for achieving and maintaining healthy cholesterol levels. Calorie restriction is an effective weight management tool, extends life span and offers anti-aging benefits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41J5oAA642L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jokari","source_asin":"B003Y3B964","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003Y3B964","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003Y3B964","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839387,"name":"HOMEFORT Sofa Side End Table, Industrial Side Table, C Shaped Table, Coffee Tray Side Desk, Beside Bed Sofa Portable Workstation, Laptop Holder Table,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OtntTc5dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A UNIQUE PIECE OF FURNITURE: A charming desk with a unique c-shaped design. With warm wood tones, this industrial table adds a contemporary feel to your home office. Great for decorating your living room, office, patio, bedroom, and more. It will match the other wood colors in your house. VERSATILE BESIDES TABLE: Function well as an end table, side table, laptop table, snack table, bedside table, and a TV tray. It acts nicely as a table for separating a seating area on the couch so two people can have a drink and a snack. It's also great for working on a laptop while enjoying the couch's comfort! Performing well as a small table next to the bed to well organize frequently accessed items, also great for the kids to sit on the sofa with their homework. DURABLE AND STABLE SNACK TABLE: Component of thicked MDF tabletop and sturdy metal frame, this end table is sturdy and durable for daily use, not wobbly. Sized at L17.16\"xW15.2\"xH22.44\"=43.6*38.6*57cm, the top shelf provides ample space for placing laptops, books, lamps, magazines, coffee, fruits, plants, etc. At 22.44\" high, it is perfect for a small bedside table or tv tray. SPACE-SAVING AND CONVENIENT: Customized for my small room. It fits well with the living room and doesn't take up too much space. It can be used horizontally in front or vertically on the side. It offers an ideal space-saving solution for those who have a tiny room. Item weight:7.04lbs/3.2kgs. ASSEMBLY AND AFTER-SALE SERVICE: It took less than 20 minutes to finish the assembly. Our 100% customer satisfaction policy can help you exchange it for the better or refund without any cost if the item does not meet your demand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OtntTc5dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEFORT","source_asin":"B08KSMTJVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KSMTJVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KSMTJVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
