window.products.push({"id":839560,"name":"Pearhead Parent Coffee Mug, Momlife Whimsical Mug, Expecting Mother Accessory, New Expecting Moms Gift, New Baby Novelty Mug, Gold Arrows Mom Life Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AK10sQStL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pearhead's #momlife ceramic coffee mug is the perfect gift for Mom. This white, wide bottom coffee mug, features gold and black detailing adding a modern and trendy touch. \"#MOMLIFE\" is printed in black on both sides of the mug and gold arrows shine all the way around the clever coffee mug. This ceramic coffee mug has a large handle to easily hold. Medium sized mug will carry all of mom's coffee. The clever coffee mug fits 2 cups or 16 fluid ounces. This ceramic mug is dishwasher safe and will sure to be mom's new favorite gift. Do not put this mug in the microwave as it's not microwave safe. Pearhead's #momlife mug makes the perfect gift for her and shows Mom how cool, fun, and appreciated she is. Give this mug to mom as a mother's day gift or a special gift anyday. Product dimensions: 5\" L x 4.5\" W x 3.75\" D. At Pearhead, we aim to create genuine, quality products to celebrate your special moments in life. We are a family of designers, marketers, and trendsetters bringing products to life that will bring a smile to your face. From concept and design to production and customer service, the Pearhead team works together seamlessly every step of the way. Whether your baby is celebrating their first year of life, you are announcing your pregnancy, or your pup is celebrating his first holiday season, Pearhead is here to share your moments in style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AK10sQStL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pearhead","source_asin":"B0BF7MK9QX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF7MK9QX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF7MK9QX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839561,"name":"Wallace Grande Baroque 4-Piece Place Setting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":202.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/118X7S7FK7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The pieces in this Wallace Grande Baroque 4-Piece Place Setting features beautiful flowers and leaves, expressing a love of adventure, luxury and romance. This 4-piece place setting includes a teaspoon, a salad fork, a place knife and a place fork. The pieces in this set are made from fine sterling silver. Mix and match with a full assortment of coordinating flatware and serveware to complete your dining and entertaining experience. For proper maintenance, pieces should be polished once or twice a year, whether or not they have been used regularly, in order to maintain their shine. These pieces should be hand-washed only; hand wash and dry immediately with a chamois or soft cotton cloth to avoid spotting. Amazon.com Grande Baroque is one of Wallace's most stately and splendid sterling silver flatware designs. Created by master silversmith William Warren in 1941, the pattern has been dressing tables with elegant sophistication ever since. This 4-piece set contains a salad fork, a dinner fork, a dinner knife, and a teaspoon. Each piece is drawn with detailed baroque styling that is substantial but exquisite. The handles feature a classic acanthus leaf at the shank and broaden gracefully into a highly wrought base accented with a gorgeous flower--a rose on the knife, a narcissus on the forks, and a five-petal blossom on the spoon. Arcing cutouts add a lacy touch to the design. Heirloom-quality, the flatware is nonetheless suitable for frequent or even daily dining and will, in fact, gain luster with use. It can even be cleaned in the dishwasher, though drying by hand is recommended. A pattern sure to be passed on through the family, Grand Baroque is covered by Wallace's lifetime warranty. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 1 place setting. Place setting includes: salad fork; place fork; knife; teaspoon. 4 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/118X7S7FK7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallace","source_asin":"B0000B33JT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000B33JT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000B33JT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839562,"name":"Maspar Terry Dish Cloth, 12 pack set, 100% cotton, 12 x12 inch, White with Red stripe, Terry, Woven, Absorbent, Quick Dry, Chemical free, Machine Wash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jou0ZfVbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Contents: Value pack of 12; 100% cotton kitchen terry towels, Size: 12x12 Inch Cloth towels that are Eco-friendly. The green alternative to paper towels. Made with sustainable, environment friendly cotton for daily use Highly Absorbent: Designed with a popcorn terry construction, these dishcloths are highly absorbent, great for drying, wiping, cleaning, scrubbing or achieving any other household task. Easy Daily Storage: Each kitchen towel comes with a hanging loop which makes it easy to store and use. Long Lasting Material: 100% Cotton Fabric, Machine Washable. Wash with Cold Water in Gentle Cycle & Tumble Dry Low. Do not bleach them or run them through a hot dryer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jou0ZfVbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"maspar","source_asin":"B07RYKZWYD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RYKZWYD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RYKZWYD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839563,"name":"Blue and White Vase","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VSj43SuCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Functional, Affordable, Luxury: Apt.4207 Blue and White Ginger Jars for Home Decor Apt.4207, New York City. Our mission is a simple one, to provide home decor items that excel in 3 categories; functional, affordable, luxury . When it comes to quality, we make no exceptions! By using world class artisans in design and the most high quality practices in production, we ensure to deliver products that give off a high-end feel, provide a handy solution and are also easy on your purse. One thing's for sure, our white and blue vase certainly didn't miss the memo! The features your home is crying out for... CONVENIENT VERSATILITY, sits regally anywhere you want it to HANDY LID, serves as a useful storage jar PERMANENT CLASS, stood the test of time, it will never go out of fashion! GORGEOUS GOLD ACCENTS, a hint of glamour CLEAN WHITE, glazed ceramic gifts your space a sharp contrast NAVY BLUE, a soothing hue to offset the white And so much more! Dimensions 4.7 inch x 4.7 inch x 7 inch Freshen up your home decor with a grandiose appeal with Apt.4207's decorative ginger jars. Steeped in history, porcelain ginger jars were first seen in palatial homes during the Ming dynasty, as a sign of class. We aim to respect this aesthetic heritage synonymous with traditional oriental decor, whilst delivering a fresh twist. By maintaining the gorgeous colors, our white and blue ceramic jar can be easily integrated into any space. Whether it be an anchoring centrepiece on a coffee table, or a subtle gap filler in a hallway, our blue and white porcelain decor jars are sure to delight! Apt.4207 Blue and White Ceramic Ginger Jars, you'll be telling your friends where you got yours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VSj43SuCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Apt. 4207","source_asin":"B0982L878K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0982L878K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0982L878K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
