window.products.push({"id":839572,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 100Pcs Air Fryer Paper Liners, Air Fryer Accessories Food Grade Parchment Paper Oil-proof, Water-Proof, Baking Paper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JR-FzDW6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food-Grade Material: High Quality air fryer disposable paper liners 6.3 inch are made of 100% food-grade pulp, oil-proof, water-proof, non-sticky. The air fryer parchment paper less likely to break with nice heat resistant and can withstand temperatures up to 428 degrees Fahrenheit, and baking paper has no effect on the taste of food. Keep Fryer Clean: The air fryer paper keep the fryer as clean as it was before use, preventing food scraps and greasy stains from being left on the cookware, simply wipe the inner tank after use. Reduce cleaning time and extend the life of your air fryer. The air fryer paper liners heightened edge 4.5cm can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. No Interfering Internal Air Circulation: The heat is generated by air circulation from the pan's wall, Our airfryer parchment liners won't affect the air circulation. When baking, the grease comes out to the air fryer basket paper which providing you healthier foods. It is the perfect air fryer accessories for your family. Easy to Use: These air fryer liners are designed with a round bowl shape for better food containment, no need to tear, fold, cut or bend the baking parchment. 100pcs air fryer disposable paper liner for food-grade, options for your daily cooking, baking, and replacement needs. And you can be directly put in when cooking and simply throw away after use. The airfryer parchment liners fit in 3-5 quart air fryers. Widely Used: The air fryer paper liner round can be used for air fryers, microwave ovens, cake pans, cookers, steamers, and ovens. Suitable for home baking, camping, BBQ, summer party, and so on, lightweight and practical. Note: To avoid burning the air fryer liners baking paper, Please do not use parchment paper for baking without food or with too little food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JR-FzDW6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOZKAA","source_asin":"B09TKBTT9V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKBTT9V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKBTT9V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
