window.products.push({"id":839798,"name":"NOVICA Handmade Green Ceramic Frog And Lilypad Sugar Bowl And Creamer Set, 4 Oz, Fancy Frogs'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Wmvp-mqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Poised to leap, a tiny tree frog sits alert and scans he forest with bright eyes. Harbingers of rains, their shrill evening song echoes through the tropical rainforest of Bali. Perched on a ceramic sugar bowl and creamer, the minuscule amphibians add their exotic charm to teatime or mealtime. This original design by Putu Oka Mahendra is crafted by hand. - Free of lead and toxins - Hand wash only About our Artist: Balinese artisan Putu Oka Mahendra inherited his ceramic legacy from his mother, Made Tantri, who pioneered ceramic artistry in 1980. At first, she undertook the entire design and crafting procedure by herself, and developed a reputation for fine design and high quality. In 1990, when Tantri passed away, Oka Mahendra took-over her work, and eventually opened a showroom in her memory. The award winning designer finds inspiration in the luscious flora and fauna of Bali.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Wmvp-mqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01MAZANEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MAZANEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MAZANEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
