window.products.push({"id":839852,"name":"COSTWAY Bar Stools Set of 2, Counter Height Dining Side Barstools, w/ Thick Cushion, Linen Surface, Nailhead Trim, Rubber Wood Legs, High Leisure Chai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71haW7+Lb0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🌻【Thickened Cushion & Premium Fabric: 】Covered with breathable and skin friendly linen, this set of 2 bar stools gives tender touch. The counter height bar chair comes with thick cushion fully padded with high resilient sponge, which provides you super comfort and stays in good shape after longtime sitting. 🌻【Rubber Wood Sturdy Construction: 】This leisure bar stool is constructed with solid rubber leg and built-in pine seat frame, which has strong resistance to corrosion, able to stand heavy weight up to 300 LBS and last for years. The reinforced beam also effectively adds to the structure stability. 🌻【Ergonomic Design for Long Time Sitting: 】These counter height barstools are featuring with comfortable and wide fabric back for users to rest their backs. And these barstools also come with considerate footrest. Meanwhile, anti-slip feet pads could effectively prevent floor from scratching. 🌻【Simple Modern Style:】 These barstools are designed with classic gray linen fabric and copper brass nail, which precisely match the noble and modern sense of the users’ home. Except for that, the dark rubber wood legs also add rustic style. These modern and rural barstools are both beautiful decoration and practical sitting chairs. 🌻【Product Details:】Overall Dimension: 18” x 21.5” x 45.5” (L x D x H), Seat Height: 30”, Seat Dimension: 16.5” x 18”, Weight Capacity: 300 LBS. No matter the shape or the actual use experience, it achieves an excellent balance, which not only highlights the beauty, but also guarantees the comfort of sitting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71haW7+Lb0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B089GB2DHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089GB2DHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089GB2DHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839853,"name":"Mellyhan 304 Stainless Steel Cocktail Shaker Bottle Set,Includes 20oz Shaker,Measuring,Strainer, Bottle pourers,bar Spoon,Muddler,Cocktail Making Kit ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71esDAT6WjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"304 STAINLESS STEEL：bar set cocktail shaker set - Made from premium quality stainless steel with a black finish coating, our classy cocktail set will handle any amount of excessive mixing and shaking - its long durability will ensure years of usage & pleasure - sturdy & reliable. COCKTAIL SHAKER SET ： 8 piece black cocktail shaker is absolutely great for professionally homemade cocktails - containing 1 cocktail shaker maker, 1 measuring (jigger) , 2 strainer, 2 bottle pourers,1 bar spoon 1 muddler, it has everything you need for that perfectly created cocktail, impressing friends & family at the party. PROFESSIONAL BARTENDER： Our Cocktail shaker set bartender kit is ideal for birthdays, parties, anniversaries, Valentine's Day, Christmas & New Years Eve - any cocktail of your choice is made possible with this great set - with the ability to create your very own favourite cocktail it's an absolute must at any party. HIGH CAPACITY：Weight 1.66LB with colour box - Cocktail shaker 600 ml - measuring jigger - 15 /30 ml. Cocktail shaker Set & bartender kit black","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71esDAT6WjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mellyhan","source_asin":"B0BMB9YJ8J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMB9YJ8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMB9YJ8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839854,"name":"Silverstro 10FT 30LEDs 5 Color Flower String Lights, Flower Theme USB & Battery Operated Fairy Lights, LED Lights for Bedroom Wedding Birthday Party C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614v+ttrBZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Home Flower Themed Decoration】Matching 3D flower string lights in five colors, it's suitable for spring or wedding decoration, allowing you to enjoy a sweet and romantic lighting experience; this is a delicate present for home decorations. 【Use First-hand Raw Materials】Our 5-color string lights use first-hand acrylic raw materials, not recycled materials. The first-hand acrylic material is more environmentally friendly, non-yellowing, and transparent, and the warm white light reveals a crystal clear light effect from the flowers. 【Memory Function & Remote Timer】Using a wireless remote control, you can easily use it to turn on/off, timer, adjust modes, and brightness. And the flower string lights have a memory function. Even if the power is turned off, it can remember the last mode & timing function, adding the convenience of use. 【Friendly Design: Low Voltage】Our flower string lights can be powered with a USB cable or battery box, 3 AA batteries (not included) are also suitable to supply power and operate, designed with low voltage, so it is safe for you to use. 【Flexible & Wide applications】The silver-plated copper wire is thin and flexible, suitable for winding around trees, fences, plants or porches, windows, and more places as night lights. You can also make DIY Christmas wreaths, garlands, craft projects, or any other items. The size of each flower is 0.87\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614v+ttrBZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silverstro","source_asin":"B08RHW7JTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RHW7JTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RHW7JTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839855,"name":"Dripstik Ice Cream and Popsicle Holder - Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QJV10xKDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Great for Birthday Parties or Traveling! Keeps kids' clothes clean by catching the sticky drips from ice cream cones or any frozen treat on a stick. THREE products in one: One end holds frozen treats on a stick. Flip the Dripstik over and the other end holds ice cream cones in almost any size and variety. Also makes frozen Popsicle treats! Fill the reservoir with juice, insert the stick attachment, freeze then enjoy! Saves parents time from cleaning up colorful puddles from forgotten desserts. Makes an easy birthday party favor! Serve ice cream without stressing about guests making a mess, then simply send the Dripstik home with them. Perfect for road trips. Indulge your children with stops at ice cream shacks without worrying about the upholstery. Let them get the cone instead of a cup and spoon. Helps disabled or elderly persons, letting them enjoy ice cream with self-sufficiency. Durable, soft plastic is long-lasting and easy-care -- simply pop into the dishwasher! Made in the USA by a mother of five! This listing is for a set of 6 in an assortment of colors: Pink, Teal, Coral & Aqua.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QJV10xKDL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dripstik","source_asin":"B003907FBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003907FBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003907FBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839856,"name":"EcoDecors Serenity Shower Stool Natural Teak Wood Shower Bench with Curved Seat and Shelf, 2-Tier Wooden Shower Seat Spa Stool in Earthy Teak Finish -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617VKmEk7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nullify ✨Heavy Duty Shower Bench: Sturdy construction with a new improved 300-pound weight capacity limit. Laboratory tested for safety. The full-length shelf adds stability as well as provides abundant storage for bathroom and shower accessories. 💫EASY ASSEMBLY- ALL TOOLS PROVIDED: Easy stress free assembly. All tools are provided and step by step videos are available. Once assembled, simply place in the shower, or location of your choice. The products come with a factory water resistant coating that makes them perfect to use in the shower. 🛠️COMPACT DESIGN: EcoDecors teak shower stool features a uniquely comfortable curved seat and anti-slip flared legs. The curved seat prevents water accumulation, keeps the bathroom seat dry, and provides a more comfortable sitting angle. 🏗️ADJUSTABLE FOOT LEVELERS: This shower seat stool is perfect for anyone looking for a safe, sturdy, and comfortable bench to use while showering. The foot pads make it easy to adjust the height of the bench with sloping shower floors, while the teak finish ensures a long-lasting product. 🌳CRAFTED WITH SUPERIOR QUALITY TEAK: EcoDecors shower stool is crafted with solid teak plantation-grown logs. Teak furniture is noticeably superior to other natural wood, and bamboo furniture, which helps them to significantly outperform in environments with high moisture content, such as showers, bathrooms, and outdoor settings. 👩WOMEN-OWNED ENTERPRISE: This teak wood shower bench is provided by a certified woman-owned company. We strive for excellence in quality, value, and customer service. Our mission is to improve people's lives through beautiful design. EcoDecors is proud to offer opportunities to women in rural villages on the island of Java, Indonesia. 💪STURDY & STABLE: The solid teak shower stool has a stunning, ergonomic design with a proprietary multi-step coating process to provide water repellency and finish longevity. Every aspect of the design has been carefully considered to provide the ultimate in beauty, comfort, function, sturdiness, and durability. ☔NATURALLY WATER RESISTANT: In addition to being carefully crafted solid teak wood naturally withstands water and moist environments due to its density, hardness, and high oil content. This is why teak wood has been the wood of choice for marine environments and outdoor furniture for hundreds of years. 🤸‍♀️VERSATILITY AND PRACTICALITY: EcoDecors shower stool can complement your home's interior design and be used as a regular stool in a bath, garden, balcony, patio, or living room. It can also be used as a stool or table in any room if you need it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617VKmEk7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EcoDecors","source_asin":"B01920JLGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01920JLGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01920JLGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839857,"name":"Waterford Crystal Lismore Pint Glass, Pair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":185.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vLme6B1LL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Crafted in lead crystal with the signature Lismore cutting pattern, these impressively substantial beer glasses are designed to enhance the flavor and appearance of any brew, from delicate Belgian Pilsners to robust English Stouts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vLme6B1LL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford","source_asin":"B01BO6DWIA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BO6DWIA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BO6DWIA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839858,"name":"PIPE DÉCOR Freestanding Industrial Pipe Clothing Rack, Commercial or Residential Wardrobe Clothes Display, Heavy Duty Rustic Vintage Steel Grey Black ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SHz9CAowL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pipe Decor Freestanding Industrial Pipe Clothing Rack, Commercial or Residential Wardrobe Clothes Display, Heavy Duty Rustic Vintage Steel Grey Black Metal Garment Frame, Double 2 Tier Design. Pipe Décor fittings, nipples and pipes are made from the highest quality materials, great for all of your do it yourself industrial inspired pipe projects. We manufacture specialty and hard to find fittings to give you even more options for your creations. Our products are authentic malleable iron which requires necessary cleaning and sealing prior to use. We recommend wearing protective gloves and using heavy duty degreasing wipes or sprays to clean. Coat with metal polish, wood wax or clear coat to prevent rusting. Start building today! Iron pipe can be crafted into a surprising number of looks and aesthetics: steampunk lighting, industrial, factory, French country farmhouse, vintage, retro, reclamation, DIY custom, exposed heating and cooling and water piping. It looks great with all types of wood and can be painted to match color schemes or clear coated neutral black or gray. Pipe Décor was founded by LDR Industries, a leading supplier of high quality kitchen, bath, plumbing and related products in the home improvement sector. Realizing that retail stores were quickly selling out of basic pieces, like flanges, the idea of Pipe Décor was born: a platform to help hobbyists find the products they need for their do-it-yourself inspired projects. With the rise of home decorating TV and DIY centered programs, Pipe Décor is a way to showcase your creativity while creating functional and visually appealing pieces that last. At Pipe Décor we’re about the community; we’re a channel where people can gauge new ideas, hear other people’s stories and learn about what items are available to create. We’re modernizing pipes and using traditional materials in new innovative ways.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SHz9CAowL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PIPE DECOR","source_asin":"B0BRBQZNPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRBQZNPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRBQZNPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839859,"name":"GreenForest Full Bed Frame with Headboard Metal Platform Bed with Reinforced 8 Middle Legs Heavy Duty Steel Slats Support Mattress Foundation for Stud","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aKWmq4H3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sturdy Structure: Full Bed Frame has a total of 14 legs, and 2 extra pillars in the middle support the bed frame, which distributes the area of thrust surface and offers great support 990 lbs weight capacity. Creative design Headboard: Metal platform bed frame has a design of double X-Headboard. It will bring trendy style into your home with quality materials and super suprised designs! When you lean against the headboard, the double-decorated headboard can hold your pillow well. You can prop soft pillows behind your back, and read books or watch TV lazily. And strong footboard can completely block your mattress from sliding out. Underbed Storage: Full Size bed frame is 78.2 x 54 x 11inch (L x W x H) , 11 inches underbed storage height, which will provide a large space underneath for storage, you could put some storage boxes under the bed to tidy your clothes, toys or quilts. Heavy Duty Steel Slats Support Noise Free: The 14 sturdy legs of full size bed can provide you with heavy support. When you turn over on the bed, the bed will be very stable. Unique plastic buckles on both ends of each metal slats will helps stabilize the bed frame and reduce the friction to avoid all noise from activities. Enjoy every silently second for a good nights sleep. No Box Spring Needed: Bed frame full size with 10 metal slats are designed to support and extend the life of your latex, memory foam or spring mattress without the need for a box spring.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aKWmq4H3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GreenForest","source_asin":"B096X6HN3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096X6HN3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096X6HN3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":839860,"name":"Evelots Draft Stopper/Blocker - Energy Saving Kitty Cat Door/Window-38 Inch-Keep Heat in-Cold Air/Noise/Odors Out","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nRj5O0e-L._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Save money on your heating bill and save energy. Keep cold air out and heat in. Regulate the temperature in your home more efficiently with this 38-inch-long cat-themed door draft guard. Weighted so it fits snugly against the bottom of your door or drafty window. Also great for blocking noise, dust, and fumes. Plush realistic looking cat draft stopper keeps your home warm and cozy while adding charm to your décor with realistic cat features including eyes, whiskers, nose, mouth, ears, tail, and paws. Like having a real cat stretched out in front of your door, without the need for a litter box Easy to store. Helps keep your floor clutter free. Comes with handy loops on either end for quick and easy storage on the doorknob or other convenient place. No risk of tripping on it when not in use. Soft fabric exterior and sand-weighted stuffing allows the draft stopper to form fit to your doors and windows. Measures approximately 38 Inches long x 4 Inches tall x 3.5 Inches deep. From our Vermont home to yours: For over 10 years, Evelots has offered customers unique products with a 30-day easy return policy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nRj5O0e-L._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evelots","source_asin":"B07L18DV2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L18DV2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L18DV2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
