window.products.push({"id":839875,"name":"Writing Computer Desk with 2 Wide Drawers Home Office Compact Desk for Small Spaces, White Desk Modern Vanity Table Laptop Notebook PC Study Table Com","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M4HtPPyHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect size writing desk: 39.5Lx20Wx30H inches size of this writing computer desk is perfect, not too big or not too small. The size of the writing desk is perfect where it's slim enough to fit in a small space, but has enough substantial space to fit multiple items on top. This computer desk is the right size for a laptop and monitor, and can be used as a vanity. You could add a mirror on top to make a vanity. Perfect size for a person using laptop, or girls using makeup. Home office desk with drawers: Storage wise this desk has the two drawers, but drawers are pretty deep and can hold a lot. The interior use of each of the 2 drawers measure 19L x 18.8W inches. Both drawers are large, pull its smoothly, and lend this piece desk a convenient spot to tuck away pens, paper, home office essentials and other cosmetics. Modern white desk: With a stylish design that features clean finish and painted in a beautiful. Crafted from manufactured wood in a neutral, two-tone finish, this computer desk also features a streamlined rectangular design with four angled legs that give it a modern feel. Adding to the sleek style of this computer desk, the drawer fronts have cutout handles. This stylish writing desk matches your furniture perfectly in bedroom or living room. Sturdy farmhouse desk: Desk's oak wood legs make it super sturdy, it can bear up to 900 pounds. Computer desk surface area is made of thick, sturdy particle board with scratch-resistant, anti-collision and waterproof design, which protect the home office desk surface from daily wear and tear. Reliable structure, crafted from engineered wood to increase durability and longevity. Easy to assemble: What's even better is you'll be able to assemble the desk in just 40 to 60 minutes. The parts were all well labeled and easily identifiable in package, and every desk hole lined up perfectly. We provide professional customer service, easy and fast replacement is available if have quality problem in one year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M4HtPPyHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"4 EVER WINNER","source_asin":"B092D93XT5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-839875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092D93XT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092D93XT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
